 labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-04T16:59:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-04T16:59:19+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164276961,"discussion_id":"28644c41ee429e8c74cf17b6e8730c47feeaa304","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n为`Range`算子的数据类型推断逻辑增加对Ascend950硬件平台的适配。该平台在处理所有输入数据类型均为`DT_DOUBLE`的场景时，可能存在精度或兼容性问题。本次修改旨在通过强制转换输出数据类型为`DT_FLOAT`来解决此问题。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了`Range`算子的数据类型推断函数`InferDataType4Range`。在原有逻辑基础上，增加了对运行平台SOC版本的判断。通过调用`PlatformInfoManager`获取平台信息，若检测到平台为`Ascend950`且所有输入类型均为`DT_DOUBLE`，则将输出类型强制设置为`DT_FLOAT`，否则保持原有逻辑不变。","created_at":"2026-03-04T16:59:43+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-04T16:59:43+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164278532,"discussion_id":"106e8687435de1f74dcf343eca6743ed7bcab368","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-04T17:07:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-04T17:07:06+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164447411,"discussion_id":"25568bb8138ed9c122fffa9f6f5422280df92f23","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-06T09:22:28+0